"builder editor (Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder, WPBakery, Brizy, Oxygen, "
"Breakdance, SiteOrigin, Visual Composer, Live Composer, MotoPress, Themify, "
"and the Customizer). Prevents the bar from covering the builder interface "
"while you edit."
msgstr ""
"Nasconde automaticamente la barra delle statistiche quando una pagina viene "
"aperta all’interno di un editor page builder visuale (Elementor, Divi, "
"Beaver Builder, WPBakery, Brizy, Oxygen, Breakdance, SiteOrigin, Visual "
"Composer, Live Composer, MotoPress, Themify e il Customizer). Evita che la "
"barra copra l’interfaccia del builder durante la modifica."

